"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"病は気からだわー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんはサザエの肝の緑の部分が嫌いすぎて見るのもイヤだそうで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ななみん、肝食べるとき言って！私目瞑ってる！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って(/_;)笑 かわいい(/_;)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではまた！おやすみー☆☆"}],"source":"archive"}}